*Youngest first-team player in European competition: [[Karamoko Dembélé]], 16 years, 294 days (against [[CFR Cluj]], 12 December 2019)<ref>{{cite news |last=Oates |first=Kathleen |title=Karamoko Dembele enters history books as Celtic youngster makes European debut against CFR Clu |url=https://www.scotsman.com/sport/football/celtic/karamoko-dembele-enters-history-books-as-celtic-youngster-makes-european-debut-against-cfr-cluj-1-5061694 |accessdate=17 December 2019 |work=The Scotsman |date=12 December 2019}}</ref>
*Oldest first-team player: [[Alec McNair]], {{age in years and days|1883|12|26|1925|4|18}} (against [[Queen's Park F.C.|Queens Park]], 18 April 1925)<ref name="par" />
*Oldest debutant: [[Kasper Schmeichel]], {{age in years and days|1986|11|5|2024|8|4}} against [[Kilmarnock]]
