===Goalscorers===
[[File:Jimmy McGrory.jpg|thumb|200px|right|upright|[[Jimmy McGrory]], Celtic's all-time top goalscorer and the record scorer in British football history|alt=Photograph of Jimmy McGrory in his playing days]]
*Most goals in all competitions: [[Jimmy McGrory]], 522<ref name="jim550" />
*Most League goals: [[Jimmy McGrory]], 396<ref name="atplg" />
*Most Scottish Cup goals: [[Jimmy McGrory]], 74<ref name="atpcup" />
*Most League Cup goals: [[Bobby Lennox]], 63<ref name="atplgcup" />
*Most European goals: [[Henrik Larsson]], 35<ref>{{cite book|last1=Cuddihy|first1=Paul|last2=Friel|first2=David|title=The Century Bhoys: The Official History of Celtic's Greatest Goalscorers|date=2010|publisher=Black & White Publishing|isbn=978-1845022976|url=https://books.google.com/books?id=2hsjAwAAQBAJ&q=celtic%27s+highest+european+goalscorer+larsson&pg=PT31|via=Google Books}}</ref>
*Most goals in one season: [[Jimmy McGrory]], 62 (during the 1927–28 season)<ref>{{cite web|title=The Most Goals Scored in a Single European Season|url=http://sportige.com/top-10-players-most-goals-single-season/|work=Sportige|accessdate=6 February 2016|date=9 April 2012}}</ref>
*Most League goals in one season: [[Jimmy McGrory]], 50 (during the 1935–36 season)<ref name="wfl">{{cite web|title=Jimmy McGrory|url=http://www.world-football-legends.co.uk/index.php/sco/27-mcgrory-jimmy|work=World Football Legends|accessdate=27 August 2015}}</ref>
*Most hat-tricks: [[Jimmy McGrory]], 56 (55 games including one double hat-trick)<ref>{{cite web|title=Hat trick list|url=http://www.fitbastats.com/celtic/player_hattricks.php|work=FitbaStats|accessdate=26 August 2015}}</ref>
*Most penalties scored: [[Mike Haughney]], 23<ref>{{cite web|title=Mike Haughney|url=http://www.scotsman.com/news/obituaries/mike-haughney-1-605747|work=The Scotsman|accessdate=27 August 2015|date=6 March 2002}}</ref>
*Most goals scored by player in a match:
**League match: [[Jimmy McGrory]], 8 goals, won 9–0 (against [[Dunfermline Athletic F.C.|Dunfermline Athletic]], 14 January 1928)<ref>{{cite web|last=Sullivan|first=Joe|title=Jimmy McGrory's record goal-scoring day|url=http://www.celticfc.net/news/7470|publisher=Celtic FC|accessdate=27 August 2015|date=14 January 2015}}</ref>
**Scottish Cup match: [[John Campbell (footballer, born 1871)|John Campbell]], 7 goals (against [[5th Kirkcudbrightshire Rifle Volunteers F.C.|5th KRV]], 17 December 1892){{Citation needed|date=May 2017}}
**Scottish League Cup match: 
***[[Bobby Lennox]], 5 goals (against [[Hamilton Academical F.C.|Hamilton Academical]], 11 September 1968){{Citation needed|date=May 2017}}
***[[Bobby Lennox]], 5 goals (against [[Partick Thistle F.C.|Partick Thistle]], 31 August 1968){{Citation needed|date=May 2017}}
***[[Stevie Chalmers]], 5 goals (against [[Hamilton Academical F.C.|Hamilton Academical]], 11 September 1968){{Citation needed|date=May 2017}}
***[[Stevie Chalmers]], 5 goals (against [[East Fife F.C.|East Fife]], 16 September 1964){{Citation needed|date=May 2017}}
**European match: [[Dariusz Dziekanowski]], 4 goals (against [[Partizan Belgrade]], 27 September 1989)<ref>{{cite book|last=Quinn|first=John|title=Jungle Tales: Celtic Memories of an Epic Stand|date=1999|publisher=Mainstream Sport|isbn=978-1840180947|url=https://books.google.com/books?id=AU4_Ap3cXb4C&q=Dariusz+Dziekanowski+partizan+belgrade&pg=PT55|accessdate=15 February 2017|via=Google Books}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|title=Celtic 5 - 4 Partizan Belgrade, European Cup Winners Cup (27/09/1989)|url=http://www.fitbastats.com/celtic/game.php?gameid=75844|work=FitbaStats|accessdate=15 February 2017}}</ref>
*Fastest goal: [[Kris Commons]] 12.2 seconds (against [[Aberdeen F.C.|Aberdeen]], 16 March 2013)<ref>{{cite web|title=Celtic's Kris Commons scores fastest ever Scottish Premier League goal|url=http://sport.stv.tv/football/clubs/celtic/218106-celtics-kris-commons-scores-fastest-ever-scottish-premier-league-goal/|work=STV Sport|accessdate=2 December 2013|date=18 March 2013|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20131203020229/http://sport.stv.tv/football/clubs/celtic/218106-celtics-kris-commons-scores-fastest-ever-scottish-premier-league-goal/|archive-date=3 December 2013|url-status=dead}}</ref>
*Youngest goalscorer: [[Jack Aitchison]], 16 years, 71 days (against [[Motherwell F.C.|Motherwell]] in [[Scottish Premiership]], 15 May 2016)<ref name="aitch" /><ref name="goalrecs">{{cite web|title=Scorer Age Records|url=http://www.fitbastats.com/celtic/player_records_scorer_age.php|work=FitbaStats|accessdate=31 August 2015}}</ref>
*Oldest goalscorer: [[Jimmy McMenemy]], {{age in years and days|1880|10|11|1919|12|6}} (against [[Motherwell F.C.|Motherwell]] in league, 6 December 1919)<ref name="goalrecs" />

